Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:58:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Activate TIN Certificate service with manual admin processing

Individual (NIN) and Corporate (RC) requests debit the wallet, stay PENDING,
and are fulfilled by an admin from a manage page (progress notes, certificate
PDF, optional TIN), mirroring CAC. Reject/refund via existing reverse action.

